# Where the API is, for the phone.
#
# Leave this EMPTY for local development: src/boot.js derives the address from
# whichever machine is serving the Expo bundle, so a laptop running
# `docker compose up` and `expo start` needs no configuration and the QR code
# works on any network.
#
# Set it to point a phone at a deployed API:
#   EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://muhai.example.com
#
# Note: `expo start --tunnel` tunnels Metro only, never your API. Under a
# tunnel this must be a publicly reachable address or every request fails.
EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=
